  "longBusinessSummary": "Nynomic AG, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells products for permanent, non-contact, and non-destructive optical measurement technology. The company also supplies customized system solutions in the areas of control engineering, sensor technology, laboratory automation, and spectrometry, as well as components and systems for industrial optical spectroscopy, including UV-VIS-NIR and Raman diode array spectroscopy with associated software solutions. In addition, it provides spectrometers, light sources for UV, VIS, and NIR; intelligent infrared measurement technology and specialty fibers for optical measurement technology products; test and calibration equipment for cameras and multi-sensor systems; and miniature incandescent lamps. The company was formerly known as m-u-t AG and changed its name to Nynomic AG in August 2018. Nynomic AG was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Wedel, Germany.",
